634
00:34:47,294 --> 00:34:49,129
"Este hijo de perra acaba de golpearme".

635
00:34:49,213 --> 00:34:51,048
"No, no chocó contigo.

636
00:34:51,131 --> 00:34:53,467
Ni siquiera te dio un coscorrón,
