673
00:36:27,895 --> 00:36:29,271
Está bien.

674
00:36:29,354 --> 00:36:32,608
Buenas noches,
mi eterna e íntima alma gemela, Phil.

675
00:36:32,691 --> 00:36:34,568
Buenas noches, Jexi.

676
